# Applies when the runtime image is built from the repository root with
# `-f runtime/python/Dockerfile`. Only the two Python packages enter the context.
*
!sdks/python
!runtime/python/pyproject.toml
!runtime/python/README.md
!runtime/python/keel
!runtime/python/pharos_runtime
!runtime/python/examples
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
**/*.egg-info
